
Fast & Slow Pointers — C# Quick Notes

Idea: Use two pointers moving at different speeds:

slow → moves 1 step
fast → moves 2 steps

Commonly used for linked lists and cycle detection.

ListNode slow = head;
ListNode fast = head;

while (fast != null && fast.next != null)
{
    slow = slow.next;
    fast = fast.next.next;
}
